,y)=\\operatorname{log}⁡(x+h+3y).\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\frac{∂f}{∂x}={lim}_{h\\to 0}(\\frac{\\operatorname{log}⁡(x+h+3y)-\\operatorname{log}⁡(x+3y)}{h}).\n$$" 13194139534874 true] [17592186316572 1000 #edb/ref 17592186316573 13194139534874 true] [17592186316572 1000 #edb/ref 17592186316574 13194139534874 true] [17592186316572 1000 #edb/ref 17592186316575 13194139534874 true] [17592186316572 1000 #edb/ref 17592186316576 13194139534874 true] [17592186316572 1000 #edb/ref 17592186316577 13194139534874 true] [17592186316572 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534874 true] [17592186316572 1041 "selection" 13194139534874 true] [17592186316572 1104 #edb/ref 17592186316577 13194139534874 true] [17592186316572 1110 #uuid "d4a1e004-7421-595f-baa8-8083abf52b65" 13194139534874 true] [17592186316573 1034 "{lim}_{h\\to 0}(\\frac{\\operatorname{log}⁡(xh+3y)-\\operatorname{log}⁡(x+3y)}{h})" 13194139534874 true] [17592186316573 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534874 true] [17592186316573 1111 #uuid "f3e166b5-fcf7-5356-b265-a9ddb6c25684" 13194139534874 true] [17592186316574 1034 "{lim}_{h\\to 0}(\\frac{\\operatorname{log}⁡(x-h+3y)+\\operatorname{log}⁡(x+3y)}{h})" 13194139534874 true] [17592186316574 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534874 true] [17592186316574 1111 #uuid "953efe5e-54c2-5d9d-a263-56e73f7599c4" 13194139534874 true] [17592186316575 1034 "{lim}_{h\\to 0}(\\frac{h\\operatorname{log}⁡(x+3y)-\\operatorname{log}⁡(x+3y)}{h})" 13194139534874 true] [17592186316575 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534874 true] [17592186316575 1111 #uuid "98a85703-86b1-5e13-b109-80748ace2883" 13194139534874 true] [17592186316576 1034 "{lim}_{h\\to 0}(\\frac{\\operatorname{log}⁡(x+3h+3y)-\\operatorname{log}⁡(x+3y)}{h})" 13194139534874 true] [17592186316576 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534874 true] [17592186316576 1111 #uuid "5227559c-34b5-5cdc-9bcb-9917281b63df" 13194139534874 true] [17592186316577 1034 "{lim}_{h\\to 0}(\\frac{\\operatorname{log}⁡(x+h+3y)-\\operatorname{log}⁡(x+3y)}{h})" 13194139534874 true] [17592186316577 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534874 true] [17592186316577 1111 #uuid "1be9ab57-bbcb-5a14-abfe-b1d21331dcdd" 13194139534874 true] [17592186316578 1017 #edb/ref 17592186316579 13194139534874 true] [17592186316578 1089 "q-159585" 13194139534874 true] [17592186316578 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045464 13194139534874 true] [17592186316578 1100 "For the function $f(x,y)=\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\operatorname{cos}⁡y-xy,$ evaluate ${f}_{x}(0,\\pi ).$" 13194139534874 true] [17592186316578 1113 #uuid "f1184a72-86fc-5f00-a377-62e4c111ae08" 13194139534874 true] [17592186316578 1145 "We differentiate the given function with respect to $x,$ treating all other variables as constants:\n\nAdditionally, we use the sum and constant multiple rules for differentiation, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}_{x}(x,y) & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}(\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\operatorname{cos}⁡y-xy) \\\\  & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}(\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\operatorname{cos}⁡y)-\\frac{∂}{∂x}(xy) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡y\\cdot \\frac{∂}{∂x}(\\operatorname{sin}⁡x)-y\\cdot \\frac{∂}{∂x}(x) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡y\\cdot (\\operatorname{cos}⁡x)-y\\cdot (1) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡y\\operatorname{cos}⁡x-y\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we evaluate the partial derivative at the point $(0,\\pi ):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}_{x}(0,\\pi ) & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\pi \\operatorname{cos}⁡0-\\pi  \\\\  & =(-1)\\cdot 1-\\pi  \\\\  & =-\\pi -1\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534874 true] [17592186316579 1000 #edb/ref 17592186316580 13194139534874 true] [17592186316579 1000 #edb/ref 17592186316581 13194139534874 true] [17592186316579 1000 #edb/ref 17592186316582 13194139534874 true] [17592186316579 1000 #edb/ref 17592186316583 13194139534874 true] [17592186316579 1000 #edb/ref 17592186316584 13194139534874 true] [17592186316579 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534874 true] [17592186316579 1041 "selection" 13194139534874 true] [17592186316579 1104 #edb/ref 17592186316